WEBVTT

00:00:09.817 --> 00:00:10.902
Dad?

00:00:12.403 --> 00:00:16.908
I'm fine. I'm just a little sunburned.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:20.578
Honey,

00:00:22.121 --> 00:00:26.250
I always thought the worst thing ever
would be seeing you go.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:29.796
But the worst is seeing you unhappy.

00:00:29.921 --> 00:00:32.882
Mavey, I want you to live your life.

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:37.261
I don't know how I'm supposed to do that.

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:42.225
You know, Mommy already
gave you her birthday present.

00:00:42.266 --> 00:00:44.268
Can I now give you mine?

00:00:46.938 --> 00:00:48.147
What do I need this for?

00:00:48.272 --> 00:00:50.733
It comes with an accessory.

00:00:52.777 --> 00:00:54.946
-You?
-You.

00:00:55.905 --> 00:00:57.281
Why are you back?

00:01:01.244 --> 00:01:03.121
'Cause you're my Zing, Mavis.

00:01:03.287 --> 00:01:05.248
I'm your Zing?

00:01:05.623 --> 00:01:08.209
But you told me you hate monsters.

00:01:08.459 --> 00:01:11.170
Yeah, well, I was afraid your dad was gonna

00:01:11.254 --> 00:01:13.506
suck all the blood out of my body
if I didn't say that.

00:01:13.631 --> 00:01:15.299
I wouldn't have...

00:01:15.425 --> 00:01:17.301
No, he's right, I would have done that.

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:20.430
-Dad.
-I was wrong, Devil-chops.

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:25.977
Do you really mean it, Dad?

00:01:27.603 --> 00:01:29.814
Go make your own paradise.

00:01:33.484 --> 00:01:35.987
Can we try that kiss over again?

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:38.656
I think we can.

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:46.330
Sorry. I just... I got to get used to that.

00:01:46.456 --> 00:01:49.042
Go. Do your thing.

00:01:59.469 --> 00:02:01.012
Stop! Stop!

00:02:06.642 --> 00:02:08.519
I thought I found a love
but she was just a fling

00:02:08.644 --> 00:02:10.354
And then I met a girl
and felt a different thing

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:12.523
It's like you're hit in the ring
Like you're pulled by a string

00:02:12.648 --> 00:02:14.317
Can't breathe
like you're choking on a chicken wing

00:02:14.358 --> 00:02:16.402
It was a thing called a Zing
and I wanted to sing

00:02:16.527 --> 00:02:18.321
And listen to ballads
of the man named Sting

00:02:18.362 --> 00:02:20.323
Lady looks in your eyes
and it's suddenly spring

00:02:20.364 --> 00:02:22.200
Like when Nala looked at Simba
in The Lion King

00:02:24.535 --> 00:02:28.164
Zinging in the air
and I don't have a care

00:02:28.206 --> 00:02:32.376
I'm winging from the Zing
that we shared

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:34.587
Zinging in the rain
Now I'm feeling no pain

00:02:35.713 --> 00:02:39.509
It's a real time for celebrating

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:41.719
'Cause you're my Zing

00:02:43.054 --> 00:02:44.639
Drac, you ready to throw down?

00:02:44.722 --> 00:02:47.892
No, no, I just came closer to hear you better.

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:49.852
Come on, just give it a try.

00:02:49.936 --> 00:02:51.896
All right, maybe just a little.

00:02:52.021 --> 00:02:53.856
So listen all you Zingers
from here to Beijing

00:02:53.898 --> 00:02:55.733
You better crash the box spring
Get ready to cling

00:02:55.775 --> 00:02:57.693
'Cause if love was money
you'd be yelling cha-ching

00:02:57.735 --> 00:02:59.529
Next to a Zing
Cupid's arrow's a little bee sting

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.572
It was a Zing and a zang
and a zingidy-dee

00:03:01.614 --> 00:03:03.407
And there was only one lady
in the Zing for me

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:04.617
'Cause when you're dinged
by the Zing

00:03:04.742 --> 00:03:06.410
You better know one thing
The only bling you gonna sling

00:03:06.536 --> 00:03:07.620
Is a wedding ring

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:13.709
Zinging in the air

00:03:13.751 --> 00:03:15.628
Now I don't have a care

00:03:15.753 --> 00:03:19.966
I'm winging from the Zing
that we shared

00:03:20.091 --> 00:03:23.553
Zinging in the rain
Now I'm feeling no pain

00:03:23.594 --> 00:03:27.431
It's a real time for celebrating

00:03:27.473 --> 00:03:28.975
'Cause you're my Zing

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:30.601
Feel the Zing, y'all
Ba-da-bing, y'all

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:32.603
Gonna knock you
right out of that ring, y'all

00:03:32.645 --> 00:03:34.480
Better bring, y'all
Happening, y'all

00:03:34.605 --> 00:03:36.482
Pay attention
to the undead king, y'all

00:03:58.462 --> 00:04:00.464
Housekeeping!

00:06:57.141 --> 00:06:59.143
I didn't do that.

